OL,3,GNEWSAGarage owner concerned by approval
OL,4,Aof 3% GST
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner has expressed concerns
OL,7,Fabout the effect changes to Guernsey's
OL,8,Ftax system will have on businesses.
OL,10,FPoliticians voted by 22 votes for and
OL,11,F17 against to approve Policy and
OL,12,FResources' (P&R) tax package consisting
OL,13,Fof GST, a 15% income tax on the first
OL,14,F#28,000 earned, higher social security
OL,15,Frates, a new annual vehicle tax, higher
OL,16,Fcorporate taxes and government savings.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
