OL,3,GNEWSAGarage owner concerned by approval
OL,4,Aof 3% GST
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Beausire, from Le Mont Saint
OL,7,FGarage, said it would have a "massive
OL,8,Feffect on business". Guernsey Retail
OL,9,FGroup said many retailers would be
OL,10,Fdisappointed and worried for the future
OL,11,Fof their business following the
OL,12,Fdecision.
OL,14,FThe States of Guernsey has been
OL,15,Fapproached for a comment.
